{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20125","headline":"奉同朝贤送新罗使 · 孟郊","name":"奉同朝贤送新罗使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淼淼望远国，一萍秋海中。\n恩传日月外，梦在波涛东。\n浪兴豁胸臆，泛程舟虚空。\n既兹吟仗信，亦以难私躬。\n实怪赏不足，异鲜悦多丛。\n安危所系重，征役谁能穷。\n彼俗媚文史，圣朝富才雄。\n送行数百首，各以铿奇工。\n宂隶窃抽韵，孤属思将同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}